Package: openalgo
Type: Package
Title: Client for the 'OpenAlgo' Algorithmic Trading Platform
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Rajandran", "R", email = "rajandran@marketcalls.in", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides access to 'OpenAlgo' <https://openalgo.in>, a
    self-hosted algorithmic trading application that connects to a stock
    broker account. Wraps the 'OpenAlgo' REST API (orders, good till
    triggered orders, market data, account, options, strategy module,
    notifications and market calendar utilities), the strategy webhook and
    the 'WebSocket' market data feed. Function names, parameters and request
    payloads follow the official 'OpenAlgo' 'Python' software development kit.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/marketcalls/openalgo-R-library, https://docs.openalgo.in
BugReports: https://github.com/marketcalls/openalgo-R-library/issues
